WEBVTT

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.240
You don't want it?

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.510
But I made it for you.

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:47.450
It's an eternal ring that will never lose its shape.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:51.000
But I don't have anything to give in return.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.090
That's okay.

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:55.530
I just wanted to see the
happy look on your face.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.350
I'm sorry.

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:08.870
Let's go.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:15.800
Maki?

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.980
Please...

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:30.880
Please let me see you smile, Maki!

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:32.750
Smile for me, too, Maki!

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.130
But, Ryu.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.030
You're always saying scary and mean things.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:40.230
Frank says so, too.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.040
Maki didn't want to go out with you.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:45.940
Or even see you.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.050
Lies!

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:51.010
It's not a lie.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:56.680
Frank's heard everything about Maki.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.780
Quit it.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.490
What does he know about her?

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:07.490
Really.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:09.730
Oh, Frank.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.630
Please smile.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:17.770
For me, too.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:19.550
Gently, just like that...

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:20.840
Smile...

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.380
For me, too...

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.110
Smile!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.740
Won't you even smile for me?

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.590
For me!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.300
Code 127.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.640
Repeat, code 127.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.760
All soldiers, report to your stations.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.610
Maki...

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.010
What did you...

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.670
...tell him?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:17.030
The charged particle bomber
has atomized the head.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.000
Target destruction confirmed.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:21.600
Move us from defense level red to yellow.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:24.070
We're off code 127.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.060
Roger.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.970
Our warning was ignored.

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.540
The attack was dangerously
close to the air base.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:34.510
Even if there was a strike called,
the condition we're in...

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.150
We couldn't have done anything, you mean?

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:39.710
We've lost SARG 3.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:44.390
And 1, 4, and 5 are all in
for repairs and rehabilitation.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.060
On the other hand, maybe that's for the best.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.100
I told you before.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:54.700
Using enemies' old weapons has been
a good tactic since ancient times.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.540
No, I was afraid if word got out...

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:00.940
No one would like it, anyway.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.840
Charged particle bomber squad pulling out.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:13.390
Readiness alert for Louisville
sector SE has been recalled.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.000
Stupid military...

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.930
Haven't they ever heard of cleaning up?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.250
That's...

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.010
Pardon me.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.860
Well, this is unexpected.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:41.600
How are you?

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.270
So-so.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:46.650
I've just had terminal bad luck for ages.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:47.910
For you.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.350
Talk about creepy.

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:52.810
I hope there won't be an earthquake.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.650
It's my way of thanking you.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.320
For sharing and understanding.

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:03.630
Here's something I'll share
so you can pass the time.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.130
Is that funny?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.540
No, it makes me happy.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.400
Thank you.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.340
But it's strange.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:24.480
That guardian angel of mine must have
a magic wand or something.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.820
I was sure they'd catch it
when they ran those tests.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.660
But I might fly again.

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:33.530
I'm still on standby, so...

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:39.990
Lieutenant?

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:41.860
You're warm.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.660
It's the warmth of life.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.270
Am I, too?

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:48.830
Yes.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:49.900
You're alive.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:51.410
We both are.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.310
What about...

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.280
...my lips?

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.490
You always...

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.090
...look like you're gazing so far away.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:31.980
About Frank...

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:36.220
It's the same no matter what test we use.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.960
The words come out gibberish.

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.260
You don't know why, do you?

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:42.590
I don't...

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:44.660
I see.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:45.890
As you were.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:50.800
Part of a hand?

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.380
That's the civilian's report.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:58.210
A piece of an alien is a strange
thing to have lying around.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.850
It's the army's recovery team's job, but...

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.410
Shall I put you through?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.550
No, we'll handle it from here.

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.490
The men could use a vacation.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.110
So?

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:29.560
Why do we have to go out collecting trash?

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:31.340
Stop complaining.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.510
You heard the captain, right?

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.210
It's R and R.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:42.650
What if a progressive-type
alien showed up now?

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:44.820
What would you do?

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.290
We can't do anything without the SARGs.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.390
Well, even if we were back at the base...

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.630
You don't ever want to use that.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.180
Your old friends...

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.880
They were all killed by aliens, right?

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:08.870
Yeah.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:13.620
The only survivors of the 16th Air
Battalion were me and the captain.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:17.780
So you're that lone cowboy
chasing down your enemies.

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:20.440
Then what about Frank?

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:21.720
Frank's...

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.330
He's our enemy.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.160
Originally.

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.290
Jeez...

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:32.240
Don't you know a friend from an enemy?

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.560
H-Hey!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.300
Attention, please!

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.230
Take it easy, dear.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.440
They're late!

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:08.690
What's Funeral doing?

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:10.980
Then you shouldn't have picked it up.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:12.450
Oh, they're here!

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:36.040
You're warm.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.220
It's the warmth of life.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:40.940
Am I, too?

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:43.440
What about my lips?

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:06.090
We'll be arriving at our
destination momentarily.

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:08.530
What's with the rough handling?

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:10.710
This is R and R, right?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.560
We're still on duty.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:14.400
Besides, we're...

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:15.470
Hold on.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.450
This is...

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:36.660
Could it be an alien?

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:38.090
Not likely.

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:40.920
This is the work of humans.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.400
Humans?

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:55.870
Hold on.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:59.230
Where does the civilian who reported this live?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:02.650
The west side, a guy named Albert Smith...

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:04.430
That means...

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.590
I can't think of any other reason.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.960
Either someone thought they
could sell it for a fortune...

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.160
Or...

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.560
Or what?

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:19.670
Anyway, let's go.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:28.710
What?

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.390
What?

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:33.180
I don't understand what you're saying, Frank.

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:39.380
What?

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:42.230
I told you!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.530
Not like that.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:47.500
Come on, I'll ask again.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.560
What were you saying was beautiful?

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.230
Eh? What?

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.300
What?

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.610
You look like you're having a good time.

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:04.180
You know you're not
supposed to play with that.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.950
What if someone found out?

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.190
B-But...

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:18.430
Sue told me if I wore
these, no one would hear.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.390
That's not the problem!

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:23.070
Lt. Green was almost killed.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.610
At a time like this, how can you...

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:31.300
How can you laugh like
that and talk to that thing?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.170
But...

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.990
Talking with Frank is fun.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:48.070
Have you forgotten?

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:53.540
His friends killed your
parents and grandfather!

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.170
Frank's different!

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:56.940
He's not different!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.740
He's the same metal beast!

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:02.740
But you helped Frank so many times before!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.230
Don't you get it?

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:11.620
I did it because I didn't
want to see your sad face...

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.790
Are you really thankful I did that?

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.320
Well?

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.890
I hate you.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.700
You're always so mean.

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:26.260
I hate you.

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:27.830
I hate you!

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:39.980
You're always like that.

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:42.480
You only show me your anger.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:43.710
Why is that?

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.880
Why do you only smile at him?

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.560
Answer me, Maki.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.850
I'm not Maki!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.430
I'm Hattie.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:56.050
I...

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:04.570
Forget it.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:06.570
Beautiful.

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:12.970
Frank...

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:15.680
You were saying that before.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:17.450
What's beautiful?

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:20.280
Beautiful...

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.710
...ring.

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.410
Ring?

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.920
Beautiful...

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:31.700
...bouquet.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.130
Awful.

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:49.780
You find something?

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.540
No, how about you?

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:53.480
This wasn't a robbery.

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:56.430
It looks like a murder.

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:59.560
What about the one who filed the report?

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:02.890
I see.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:15.770
It seems they got what they came for.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:18.470
But why the whole village?

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:23.270
We're all humans.

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.780
Now the aliens look a lot better.

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:28.480
I agree.

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:30.930
I'm reporting in.

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:35.130
Do you read me?

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.360
Funeral HQ.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.450
Interference?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:46.900
Get down!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:48.680
It's them!

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:49.670
That means...

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.730
Yes.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:53.810
It seems they still don't
have what they came for.

00:17:58.250 --> 00:17:59.240
How...

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:01.420
...did you...

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:05.750
Ring...

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.360
You remembered!

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:16.230
When I gave you that flower ring!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:17.830
Flower?

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:19.500
Thank you.

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:21.970
Flowers...

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:24.510
...beautiful.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:27.040
Thank you...

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.110
...Hattie.

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:34.450
Do you read me, Lt. Soma?

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:35.030
Yes.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:36.860
You're needed in the command room.

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:39.160
We have a transmission from Dan and Sue.

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:40.300
Roger.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.290
On my way.

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:42.850
Yeah.

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:48.080
Yeah, I'm happy too, Frank.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:00.230
Not as good as Guenevere.

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:07.490
This isn't the time to worry about that!

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:09.020
It's a .50 caliber!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.590
This isn't going to hold at all.

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:14.250
This way.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.090
We could make it.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:37.940
This...

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.620
...isn't ordinary metal.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:40.880
No way.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.690
Didn't you see that?

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:46.260
A direct hit and it isn't even scratched...

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:51.500
Hurry up!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:52.870
We have to take this!

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.830
This isn't the time!

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.230
Run!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:14.820
We're taking off!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.000
That was a close one...

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.470
It was stupid.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.940
No, it was more than stupid.

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:32.610
What?

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:34.840
They didn't cut off our escape route.

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.540
I guess that's true...

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:38.870
But...

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:43.040
Maybe that wasn't a piece of an alien.

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:45.280
What makes you think that?

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:47.850
Carved inside...

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:51.360
...were English letters and
something that looked like a date.

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:52.850
I guess so.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.190
If it belongs to an alien,

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:58.320
it would be the size of their engagement rings.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.260
That's true.

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:03.910
By the way, you know why engagement rings

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:06.530
are worn on the ring
finger of the left hand?

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:08.000
No.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.400
Long ago,

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:13.480
people thought that finger
was linked directly to the heart.

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:16.950
I see.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.620
Till death do us part...

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:35.810
Radar alert system 22
has detected 5 new aliens.

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:37.700
Baalzephon locked on.

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.040
Preparing to fire.

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:40.940
Will they force our ace?

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:50.090
First alien entering atmosphere.

00:21:50.090 --> 00:21:52.520
Heading for northeast sector, Kansas.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.620
Defense level yellow.

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:58.250
All essential personnel to the holding area.

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:01.190
Does this mean I...

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:07.900
I hate him.

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:10.500
Frank...

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:16.230
I hate him.

00:22:36.670 --> 00:22:39.540
The dancing angels of death have called out.

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:44.170
The time has come to repay the
debts of life and play the final card.

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:48.110
Next time,
Punishment and Awakening.
